WEBVTT

00:15:57.197 --> 00:16:00.347
there are teachers who are not
nearly as good or experienced.

00:16:00.371 --> 00:16:04.823
So a system has been created
by a number of companies we invested in

00:16:04.847 --> 00:16:09.014
so that the super teacher
can, through video conference,

00:16:09.038 --> 00:16:12.061
teach maybe 30 classrooms

00:16:12.085 --> 00:16:14.552
with 1,000 students at the same time.

00:16:14.903 --> 00:16:16.387
So in this case,

00:16:16.411 --> 00:16:20.675
it's video-conferencing,
broadcasting the teacher to the students,

00:16:20.699 --> 00:16:25.442
and coming back
are 1,000 faces on a giant screen

00:16:25.466 --> 00:16:27.085
that the teacher can see.

00:16:27.109 --> 00:16:30.633
So now, when a student
raises his or her hand,